# Rule: SignNonzeroReflection
# Before (rejected):
# forall x R:
#     sign(x)!=0
#     =>:
#         x!=0
# Former behavior: strict run success=false, phase search_proof.
# Now (verified directly):
forall x R:
    sign(x)!=0
    =>:
        x!=0

# Boundary: Requires the checked sign(x)!=0 premise; no claim that x equals 1 or -1.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_rule/sign_nonzero_reflection.lit
# Regression: tests/unit/execute/legacy_six_simple_bt/tests.rs
